OL,3,GNEWSAHomicides in Scotland rise from
OL,4,Arecord low
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of people who were killed in
OL,7,FScotland last year was almost a fifth
OL,8,Fhigher than the record low of the
OL,9,Fprevious year, new figures show.
OL,11,FThe latest stats released by the
OL,12,FScottish government show that 56
OL,13,Fhomicides were recorded in 2025-26 - 41
OL,14,Fmen and 15 women.
OL,16,FThis was nine more than the 47 killings
OL,17,Fin 2024-25 but was it still the fourth
OL,18,Flowest on record - and less than half
OL,19,Fof the 121 homicides recorded 20 years
OL,20,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
