OL,3,GNEWSAHomicides in Scotland rise from
OL,4,Arecord low
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest figures showed that
OL,7,Ftwo-thirds of the female victims were
OL,8,Fkilled by their partner or ex-partner,
OL,9,Fthe highest rate since these records
OL,10,Fbegan in 2006.
